	(text "H1-H4: four corner M1.6 mounts.\n20 x 46 mm PCB faces / TPU spacer.\nStandoff height and screw length TBD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 148 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b544356-1a55-4336-9aa5-ba8e69726830")
	)
	(text "External supply entry\nthrough J101: GND and VBAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "543d6e01-1106-4a93-b6fb-7abda4a40a5a")
	)
	(text "1  Switched 3.3 V: daughterboard -> all eight pods\n2  Common ground\n3  ESP TX through R42 -> pod 0 RX\n4  Protected VBAT bus: seven cells <-> charger\n5  Last pod TX return -> ESP RX"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5f7834ef-8d27-4500-ac44-1033d8b87b11")
	)
	(text "CONTROLLER DAUGHTERBOARD / FIVE-CONTACT STACK INTERFACE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "710fec7f-feb7-4e91-96c7-a5a670fd153a")
	)
	(text "CHAIN AND RETURN\nDaughterboard J101 -> pod 0 J1. Each pod J2 -> next pod J1.\nPods 0-6: JP1 NORMAL (1-2). Pod 7: cut 1-2, bridge 2-3 END.\nPod 7 J2 is uncabled. The clasp gap remains unwired."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7e36bad7-bd80-4e70-8a4d-14775cdfc637")
	)
	(text "SYSTEM ASSEMBLY\nOne controller daughterboard; eight copies of satellite/satellite.kicad_pro.\nPod 0 sits beneath this board: no battery and no external NTC fitted.\nPods 1-7 each carry one protected pouch cell and its external NTC.\nThe pod PCBA and component population are identical in all positions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "96408d91-16fd-41dc-8660-74310d974803")
	)
	(text "J101 connects pin-for-pin to J1 on universal pod 0.\nThe existing five-pad footprint is retained until the mechanical stack is set."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bc443517-da7f-457c-9333-e4e504dbabef")
	)
	(text "POWER AND TEMPERATURE\nAll eight M2003/DRV2625 nodes share switched +3V3_POD.\nOnly pod 0 battery/NTC sockets are unused; keep its sensing/fuse circuitry.\nFirmware expects seven required cell sensors on pods 1-7.\nDisable charging if a required sensor is missing, stale or out of range.\nSeven-cell charge/load limits still require firmware configuration."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f0dcc5cb-3940-4e36-bb7a-015a49166c9b")
	)
